    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a129c4b9bfa834aa5588db29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果急忙改跑草地而无法发挥风水的力量，\n就太得不偿失了。\n最后也帮不到任何人。所以──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e30baee6f2ad294f22f41351f4aec62d5139f5cf2a71f97249ba13e2ce30648d",
